# Schemas

P07 and later schema-owning passes generate wire-visible artifact schemas from Rust `JsonSchema` derives:

```bash
cargo run -p aidens-cli -- schemas generate
cargo run -p aidens-cli -- schemas check
```

Generated schemas live under `schemas/<artifact-family>/vN.schema.json`.
`generated_schema_manifest_v1.json` records the generated set and schema digests.

The remaining `*.sketch.json` files are historical design sketches only; they are not the compatibility gate.
